ule for the final week of the regular season early Sunday morning.","published":"2026-11-22T21:14:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50564960/pac-12-reveals-unique-flex-schedule-season-final-week","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Montana State ranked No. 1, 5-7 LIU makes FCS bracket as conference champ","description":"Defending national champion Montana State received the top seed for the 24-team FCS playoffs, while Northeast Conference champion LIU (5-7) became the first playoff team with a losing record since 2017.","published":"2026-11-22T21:06:57.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50564910/montana-state-grabs-top-seed-24-team-fcs-playoff-bracket","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Wake Forest rewards DC Scottie Hazelton with contract extension","description":"Wake Forest defensive coordinator Scottie Hazelton has signed a contract extension.","published":"2026-11-22T21:01:26.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50564902/wake-forest-rewards-dc-scottie-hazelton-extension","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026 college football coaching carousel: Tracking every open job","description":"As the carousel spins, we'll keep you updated with all the comings and goings.","published":"2026-11-22T20:32:48.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50358611/2026-cfb-coaching-carousel-firings-hirings","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who are the candidates and what are the priorities after TCU fired Sonny Dykes?","description":"Things started well for Dykes, but now the Horned Frogs are looking for a new coach and should have options.","published":"2026-11-22T19:55:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50323301/tcu-candidates-personnel-recruits","type":"Story","byline":"Eli Lederman, Max Olson and Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-22T19:15:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"No Big Ten football teams in AP top 5 for first time since 2021","description":"A weekend of Big Ten upsets left the conference without a team in the top five of the AP Top 25 college football poll for the first time since 2021.","published":"2026-11-22T20:22:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50563638/no-big-ten-football-teams-ap-top-5-first-21","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"TCU fires coach Sonny Dykes; expected to be owed more than $20M, per sources","description":"TCU has fired coach Sonny Dykes, who led the Horned Frogs to an appearance in the 2023 CFP title game in his first season.","published":"2026-11-22T20:13:49.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50563619/tcu-fires-coach-sonny-dykes-sources-say","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"AP college football Week 12 poll reaction: What's next for Top 25","description":"A look at the AP rankings, along with a key stat and what's ahead for each team.","published":"2026-11-22T21:04:23.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50562947/week-12-ap-college-football-poll-reaction-next-top-25","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Indiana State not extending Curt Mallory's contract, ending coach's 10-year run","description":"Indiana State is looking for a new football coach after announcing Curt Mallory will not return for an 11th season.","published":"2026-11-22T18:26:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50563345/indiana-state-not-extending-coach-curt-mallory-contract","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4899483/sammy-omosigho","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sammy_Omosigho"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Sammy Omosigho","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sammy_Omosigho","description":"American football linebacker (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-22T04:18:11Z","intro":"Samuel Omosigho (born September 17, 2004) is an American football linebacker for the UCLA Bruins. He previously played for the Oklahoma Sooners.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Omosigho attended Crandall High School in Crandall, Texas. Coming out of high school, he was rated as a four-star recruit, where he held offers from Florida, TCU, and Oklahoma. Ultimately, Omosigho committed to play college football for the Oklahoma Sooners."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"In his first collegiate season at the University of Oklahoma in 2023, Omosigho played in 10 games, notching seven tackles with half a tackle for a loss. During the 2024 season, Omosigho played all 13 games, recording 39 tackles with five being for a loss, six pressures, a pass deflection, and a forced fumble.\nHeading into the 2025 season, he was named to the Butkus Award watch list and earned a starting spot at linebacker for the Sooners. In week one of the 2025 season, Omosigho totaled eight tackles and his first career sack in a season opening win over Illinois State. In week 12, he recorded six tackles and a fumble recovery in an upset win over Alabama.\nIn 2026, Omosigho transferred to the University of California, Los Angeles, to play for the Bruins. He was a first-team midseason All-American selection by the Associated Press and was named a semifinalist for the Butkus Award."}]}}